Well, I had the same problem, and it seems that X11 Nethack will not run 
under OpenWindows for some reason or another.  You have two choices, either
run a standard X server instead of the Sun hack of it (the standard one 
is faster anyway), or run with tty as you interface.  Actually, I can get
nethack to run under OW, I just can't get any of the fancy fonts.  If you 
do want to run Nethack under OW, you will have to comment out the OBJECTS=
and GRAPHICS= lines in your .nethackrc that correspond to the nh10 font.
This will solve the problems you had with  the map display being messed up.

